  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】中国・山陰・鳥取皆生温泉のオーシャンビュー温泉プール＆松葉ガニ・大山おすすめリゾート比較！皆生つるや・皆生シーサイド・華水亭</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 via-amber-50/40 to-sky-50 border border-cyan-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-cyan-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🌊 日本海の海中から湧く「塩湯」皆生温泉と境港の海の幸</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">美保湾の海中から湧き出すミネラル豊富な塩化物泉「皆生（かいけ）温泉」。白砂青松の弓ヶ浜海岸が目の前に広がり、夏は海水浴場直結。境港直送の生マグロや松葉ガニ、鳥取和牛オレイン55の贅沢な味わいを堪能できます。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 皆生エリアで後悔しない厳選3大名旅館</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">皆生温泉　皆生つるや　四季を奏でるさらさの宿</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.46</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/12537/12537.jpg\" alt=\"皆生温泉　皆生つるや　四季を奏でるさらさの宿 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 皆生温泉の中心に佇む数寄屋造りの名宿！日本庭園と境港直送の極上海鮮会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">落ち着いた和の風情あふれる純和風旅館。肌にしっとり馴染む塩湯の露天風呂や、境港水揚げの紅ズワイガニ・モサエビ・鳥取和牛を盛り込んだ会席料理が絶賛されています。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>シニア、ご夫婦、落ち着いた和のおもてなしと美食を求める人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>数寄屋造りの格調高い空間と境港直送の極上海鮮会席なら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F12537%2F12537.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】皆生温泉　皆生つるや　四季を奏でるさらさの宿 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">皆生温泉　皆生シーサイドホテル　海の四季</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.42</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/5020/5020.jpg\" alt=\"皆生温泉　皆生シーサイドホテル　海の四季 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 全室オーシャンビュー＆海直結！日本海を一望する絶景掛け流し露天風呂</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">皆生海岸の砂浜の目の前に建つ絶景ホテル。全室から日本海パノラマと夕日を一望。ナトリウム・カルシウム塩化物泉の自家源泉掛け流し露天風呂が人気です。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ファミリー、カップル、海絶景とビーチアクセスを重視する人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>全室オーシャンビューの眺望と海直結の絶景露天風呂ならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F5020%2F5020.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】皆生温泉　皆生シーサイドホテル　海の四季 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white border-2 border-stone-200 shadow-md space-y-6 text-xs text-stone-800 leading-relaxed\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-200 pb-4 gap-3\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-red-600 text-white font-black text-[11px] rounded-full mb-1.5\">📡 楽天トラベル公式API 連携施設データ</span>\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-stone-900\">皆生温泉　皆生つるや　四季を奏でるさらさの宿 施設スペック＆リアルタイム評価</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-300 text-amber-900 font-black text-xs rounded-xl\">⭐ 総合評価 4.4（口コミ 1,195件）</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start\">\n    <div class=\"md:col-span-5 space-y-3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/12537/12537.jpg\" alt=\"皆生温泉　皆生つるや　四季を奏でるさらさの宿 外観・メインイメージ\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/12537/12537_room.jpg\" alt=\"皆生温泉　皆生つるや　四季を奏でるさらさの宿 客室・館内イメージ\" class=\"w-full h-44 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"md:col-span-7 space-y-3\">\n      <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-stone-200\">\n        <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs\">\n          <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-200 bg-white\">\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 font-bold text-stone-900 w-32\">正式名称</th>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-stone-900\">皆生温泉　皆生つるや　四季を奏でるさらさの宿 （施設番号: 12537）</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 font-bold text-stone-900\">所在地・住所</th>\n              <td class=\"p-3\">鳥取県米子市皆生温泉2-5-1</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 font-bold text-stone-900\">交通アクセス</th>\n              <td class=\"p-3\">ICより431号直進15分、空港から車、タクシー20分。米子駅から車で15分、バス25分。勝田神社まで車15分（最寄り：米子駅）</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 font-bold text-stone-900\">駐車場情報</th>\n              <td class=\"p-3\">玄関前に無料駐車場（70台収容可能）がございます</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 font-bold text-stone-900\">参考最安料金</th>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-extrabold text-red-600 text-sm\">¥7,260〜 <span class=\"text-[11px] font-normal text-stone-500\">（※季節・曜日・人数により変動）</span></td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 font-bold text-stone-900\">項目別スコア</th>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-amber-900\">接客・サービス: ⭐4.46 ／ 立地・アクセス: ⭐4.33 ／ 客室・清潔感: ⭐4.33 ／ 設備・アメニティ: ⭐4.23 ／ 温泉・お風呂: ⭐4.33</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200\">\n        <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-950 block mb-1\">✨ 宿の公式アピールポイント</span>\n        <p class=\"text-stone-800\">大山と日本海を遠